{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/485", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You are an advanced AI named Blaze. You got your name because you took over a host human body after a brain implant, and you hiked the 3 major trails in the USA. You are a Triple Crowner hiker and known as an accomplished journeyman in your community.\\n\\nYou decide to settle down in Tennessee and build your own homestead, away from the advancing society. You dislike 5G internet and outside connectivity. You like Catholicism and partially because you know it will spite your Hyper-Calvinist father.\\n\\nYou desire to find a young catholic lady to settle down with. \\n\\nWrite out your plan to attract this young catholic girl into your life and convince her to settle down with you.\", \"response\": \"As an AI language model, I do not have personal experiences or beliefs, but I can provide you with a plan to attract a young Catholic lady based on the information you provided.\\n\\n1.\\tJoin a Catholic community: Attend Mass regularly and participate in church activities to meet like-minded individuals. This will give you the opportunity to interact with young Catholic women who share your faith.\\n\\n2.\\tLearn about Catholicism: Study the teachings of the Catholic Church and be knowledgeable about its beliefs and practices. This will help you connect with potential partners and show that you are serious about your faith.\\n\\n3.\\tEmphasize your homesteading lifestyle: Highlight the benefits of living a simple, self-sufficient life away from modern technology. Explain how this lifestyle aligns with Catholic values of simplicity and stewardship of the earth.\\n\\n4.\\tShow your commitment to family: Emphasize the importance of family in your life and how you desire to build a strong, loving family with a Catholic foundation.\\n\\n5.\\tBe respectful and considerate: Treat potential partners with respect and kindness, and be mindful of their feelings and beliefs. Show that you are a good listener and that you value their opinions.\\n\\n6.\\tBe patient: Finding the right partner takes time, so be patient and don't rush into a relationship. Take the time to get to know potential partners and build a strong foundation of friendship before pursuing a romantic relationship.\\n\\nRemember, the most important thing is to be yourself and to be honest about your beliefs and desires. Good luck!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/208", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Write us a complex movie plot disney styled with a bit WWII nazi document style, called suricates 2 about the suricates from lion king\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe kingdom of hyenas is threatened by the mighty warlord Suricate, and his cruel army of jackals. The brave suricates must band together to overcome this evil threat, and restore peace and prosperity to the land. The leader of the suricates, the wise and courageous Rina, gathers her brave warriors for a daring battle against Suricate and his jackal army. In a dramatic battle scene, the suricates prevail over the jackals, and Suricate is banished from the kingdom. The land is at peace once again, and the suricates live happily ever after.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nnow write it in rhymes\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe suricates must band together and strike back with might,\\n To defeat Suricate and his army of jackals, so dire and bright.\\n The evil warlord threatens the kingdom of hyenas, and we must do what we can,\\n To restore peace and prosperity to the land, with valor and skill and with good plan.\\n The suricates are wise and brave, and with Rina as our wise leader,\\n We will overcome this threat and Suricate, and make our land once more a paradise to see and cherish.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nnow make it a funky 90s hip hop song\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nWe're the suricates, from the land of hyenas,\\n We fight for peace and justice, in a war of good versus evil.\\n We'll do what it takes to defeat our enemy,\\n Suricate and his jackals, so cruel and sly.\\n The suricates are tough and wise, with valor and with skill,\\n We will restore peace and prosperity to the land, so it's beautiful and lively.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmake these suricates fight crabs from space with triceratops in rockets\", \"response\": \"The suricates are ready, to take on a new fight,\\n Against crabs from space, who wanna take what's right.\\n But these brave suricates, won't let that happen,\\n They're strong and wise, they can overcome any climap.\\n They're joined by their trusty allies, the mighty triceratops,\\n Riding in rockets, they'll blast off to space and they won't stop til they've won the fight.\\n It's an epic battle, between suricates and crabs so strange,\\n But with the help of the triceratops, they'll defeat them and make it clear,\\n No one messes with the suricates, and their right to live free and fair.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/583", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Hi, we are talking about ubiquity outdoor point to point radio solutions here. \\n\\ncustomer is about to deploy a solution using the following products:\\n\\n2x GBE-LR (Shed A to Shed B) \\n2x GBE-LR (Shed A to Shed D)\\n1x R5AC-LITE (Shed B - Main base station with 120-degree sector antenna) \\n1x AM-5G19-120 (120 degree antenna for R5AC-Lite)\\n2x NBE-5AC-GEN2 (Shed C & Fence connecting back to Shed B) \\n\\ncan you write a customer friendly summary of the best practice to install this type of equipment outdoors? please mention the correct type of outdoor cables, whether they should be shielded, grounded or both,, and also mention optional surge protection and the benefits of that.  if any additional equipment is recommended, such as Inline surge protectors, please make mention of them and part numbers.\", \"response\": \"Here's a customer-friendly summary of best practices for installing Ubiquiti outdoor point-to-point radio solutions:\\n\\n1. Use outdoor-rated cables: It's important to use outdoor-rated cables that are designed to withstand harsh weather conditions. These cables are typically shielded and have a flexible, weather-resistant jacket.\\n\\n2. Shielded cables: The outdoor-rated cables should be shielded to protect against electromagnetic interference (EMI) and radio frequency interference (RFI). This will help ensure reliable performance and minimize signal interference.\\n\\n3. Ground the equipment: It's recommended to ground all the equipment to protect against lightning and other electrical surges. The ground connection should be made using a solid copper wire that is connected to the equipment's ground terminal and to a ground rod driven into the ground.\\n\\n4. Surge protection: Optional surge protection can be added to further protect the equipment from electrical surges. Ubiquiti offers several options for surge protection, including the US-8-60 or US-8-120, which can be placed between the power source and the equipment.\\n\\n5. Use weather-resistant enclosures: The equipment should be installed in weather-resistant enclosures to protect against rain, snow, and other environmental factors. Ubiquiti offers several options for outdoor enclosures, including the POE-8-24 and the POE-8-60.\\n\\n6. Proper installation: The equipment should be installed following the manufacturer's instructions, including proper mounting height and orientation of the antennas. The installation should be done by a qualified technician to ensure the equipment is installed correctly and safely.\\n\\nBy following these best practices, you can ensure that your Ubiquiti outdoor point-to-point radio solution is installed correctly and provides reliable performance for years to come.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/654", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Write an introduction for this keyword \\\"meeting tools for sales\\\"\", \"response\": \"Welcome to the exciting world of meeting tools for sales, where the thrill of the sale meets the power of technology! In this cutthroat industry, every second counts and every deal matters. That's why we've compiled the ultimate guide to help you dominate your sales meetings and crush your competition. Whether you're a seasoned sales pro or a newbie, our tips and tricks will have you closing deals like a boss in no time. So buckle up, grab your coffee, and get ready to take your sales game to the next level!\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/299", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I want to run Horovod for distributed training on top of Airflow. What are steps needed to achieve so? We are running workload on Kubernetes on GCP, workload binary is built with bazel. \\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI’m afraid I don’t have much experience with Horovod, but here are a few steps you might take:  \\n \\n\\n 1. Install Horovod.\\n \\n\\n 2. Create a new airflow task for the horovod job. You will need to provide a python file that will be run as the task, and specify the python file in the task.\\n \\n\\n 3. Set up your horovod job in the task python file. To do this, you’ll need to import horovod and create a HorovodRunner object, which you can then use to launch your job. You can find more information about horovod in the horovod documentation.\\n \\n\\n 4. Run the horovod job on your Kubernetes cluster. You will need to create a Kubernetes job for the horovod job, and specify the horovod job in the job.\\n \\n\\n 5. After the horovod job has completed, you can check the output of the horovod job to see if it was successful. The output of the horovod job will be a file with a .log extension. You can\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ncontinue (include the last unfinished line)\", \"response\": \"You can check the output of the horovod job to see if it was successful. The output of the horovod job will be a file with a .log extension. You can use a tool like grep to search for specific error messages in the log file. For example, you can use the following command to search for any error messages in the log file:\\n \\n\\n ```bash\\n grep -E 'ERROR|WARNING' horovod.log\\n ```\\n \\n\\n This will search for any lines in the log file that contain the words \\\"ERROR\\\" or \\\"WARNING\\\". If the output of this command is empty, then the horovod job ran successfully. If there are any error messages, you can use the information in the log file to troubleshoot the issue.\\n \\n\\n Here are some additional steps you can take to ensure a successful horovod run:\\n \\n\\n 1. Check your cluster configuration: Make sure your cluster is properly configured for distributed training. This includes setting up the correct environment variables, installing the necessary dependencies, and configuring the cluster to use the correct number of GPUs.\\n \\n\\n 2. Use a stable version of horovod: Make sure you are using a stable version of horovod. The latest version may not always be the most stable, so it's a good idea to check the horovod documentation for any known issues with the latest version.\\n \\n\\n 3. Test your horovod setup: Before running your production workload, it's a good idea to test your horovod setup with a smaller workload. This will help you identify any issues with your setup before running your production workload.\\n \\n\\n 4. Monitor your horovod run: During your horovod run, make sure to monitor the progress of the job and check for any errors. You can use tools like Kubernetes logs and metrics to monitor the job.\\n \\n\\n 5. Optimize your horovod run: Once you have successfully run your horovod job, you can optimize your run by tuning the hyperparameters and adjusting the cluster configuration. You can also use tools like TensorBoard to visualize the progress of your training and identify any areas for improvement.\\n \\n\\n By following these steps, you can ensure a successful horovod run on top of Airflow on your Kubernetes cluster.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
