{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/688", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"write a play where tamil and sanskrit argue themselves on superiority\\n\", \"response\": \"Here's a short play where Tamil and Sanskrit argue about their superiority:\\n\\nTitle: The Language Debate\\n\\n(The stage is set with two chairs, one for Tamil and one for Sanskrit. The lights come up, and Tamil and Sanskrit enter the stage and take their seats.)\\n\\nTamil: Good evening, Sanskrit. I'm glad we're finally able to have this conversation about the superiority of our languages.\\n\\nSanskrit: Indeed, Tamil. I'm eager to discuss this matter. I believe that Sanskrit is the most superior language in the world.\\n\\nTamil: Oh, really? I think Tamil is the best language out there. It's rich in history and has a unique grammar and syntax.\\n\\nSanskrit: But Sanskrit is the language of the Vedas and the Upanishads, the ancient texts of India. It's the language of spirituality and philosophy.\\n\\nTamil: True, but Tamil has its own set of ancient texts, such as the Tirukkural, which are considered some of the greatest works of literature in the world.\\n\\nSanskrit: However, Sanskrit is a more logical and analytical language, while Tamil is more emotional and expressive.\\n\\nTamil: That's not true! Tamil has a rich literary tradition that has produced some of the greatest poets and writers in history.\\n\\nSanskrit: But Sanskrit is the language of the Vedas and the Upanishads, the ancient texts of India. It's the language of spirituality and philosophy.\\n\\nTamil: True, but Tamil has its own set of ancient texts, such as the Tirukkural, which are considered some of the greatest works of literature in the world.\\n\\nSanskrit: However, Sanskrit is a more logical and analytical language, while Tamil is more emotional and expressive.\\n\\nTamil: That's not true! Tamil has a rich literary tradition that has produced some of the greatest poets and writers in history.\\n\\nSanskrit: In conclusion, both languages have their own unique strengths and weaknesses. The superiority of a language cannot be determined by a single factor. It's up to each individual to decide which language they prefer and find most useful.\\n\\n(The lights dim, and Tamil and Sanskrit exit the stage.)\\n\\nNote: This is a fictional play, and the arguments made by Tamil and Sanskrit are not necessarily reflective of real-life opinions or beliefs. The purpose of the play is to entertain and provide a light-hearted look at the topic of language superiority.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/459", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I am using an Aura-based experience builder site. On the site  I have a lwc that I have enabled Light DOM for. I am doing this because I want to target a child button element from a sibling Aura component that is using an external Js library called IntroJS. IntroJs needs to target an element in order to attatch tour steps.\\n\\nAfter enabling the Light DOM, I am able to enter the chrome console and use document.Query selector and I get a result however when I use document.querySelector from the Aura component I get null. Why is that?\", \"response\": \"There could be several reasons why you are getting null when using document.querySelector from your Aura component, even though you are able to select the element using the Chrome console. Here are a few possible explanations:\\n\\n1. Scope: The Light DOM of a Lightning Web Component is not visible to the Shadow DOM of an Aura component. This means that the Aura component may not be able to access the Light DOM elements of the LWC, and therefore, the element you are trying to target may be invisible to the Aura component.\\n\\n2. Timing: It's possible that the element you are trying to target is not yet available when the Aura component is trying to access it. This could be due to the element being dynamically created or because the page has not finished loading.\\n\\n3. Syntax: It's possible that you are using the wrong syntax or selector when trying to target the element from the Aura component. Make sure that the selector you are using is correct and matches the element you are trying to target.\\n\\n4. Permissions: The Aura component may not have the necessary permissions to access the Light DOM elements of the LWC. Make sure that the LWC is marked as \\\"accessible\\\" to the Aura component in the LWC's metadata.\\n\\nTo troubleshoot this issue, you can try the following:\\n\\n- Use the Chrome console to check if the element is dynamically created or only available after a certain event.\\n- Use console.log statements to verify that the element is available and visible to the Aura component.\\n- Check the syntax and selector used in the document.querySelector call from the Aura component.\\n- Verify that the LWC is marked as \\\"accessible\\\" to the Aura component in the LWC's metadata.\\n\\nBy troubleshooting these possible issues, you should be able to identify the root cause of the problem and find a solution to target the child button element from the sibling Aura component.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/445", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Use these categories:\\n\\nfinancial calculators\\nmeasurement calculators\\nmath calculators\\ndate and time calculators\\nastrology calculators\\nhealth calculators\\nhome calculators\\nstatistics calculators\\ngaming calculators\\npersonal finance calculators\\nfun calculators\\n\\nAnd categorize the following term:\\n\\nhigh school gpa calculator\", \"response\": \"The term \\\"high school gpa calculator\\\" would fall under the category of \\\"math calculators.\\\" GPA (Grade Point Average) is a numerical representation of a student's academic performance and is calculated by dividing the total number of grade points earned by the total number of credit hours attempted. A GPA calculator is a tool that helps students and parents calculate a student's GPA based on their grades and credit hours.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/277", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I require your assistance to draft some articles.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI’m happy to help. Please let me know what the articles are about, and any specific information you want me to include.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nIn my messages that I send you later, I will refer to this information as Information About Myself. \\n \\n\\n Here is a bit of information about myself that I want you to know. I am a solicitor and construction lawyer with more than 10 years experience specialising in construction law. I regularly advise homeowners and builders regarding their contractual and legal rights. I represent homeowners and builders in NSW, Australia as well as all courts of competent jurisdiction. I have advised homeowners, builders, and contractors experience regarding latent conditions. I have advised them on their contract rights, risks and obligations. I have negotiated and amended contracts to reflect their intentions.\", \"response\": \"Sure, I'd be happy to help you draft some articles based on the information you provided about yourself. Here are a few ideas:\\n \\n\\n 1. \\\"10 Years of Experience in Construction Law: A Q&A with a Specialist Solicitor\\\"\\n \\n\\n In this article, you could provide more details about your background and experience in construction law. You could also answer common questions that homeowners and builders have about their contractual and legal rights. This would be a great opportunity to showcase your expertise and establish yourself as a thought leader in the field.\\n \\n\\n 2. \\\"Latent Conditions in Construction: What You Need to Know\\\"\\n \\n\\n In this article, you could discuss the concept of latent conditions in construction and how they can impact homeowners and builders. You could provide practical advice on how to identify and address latent conditions, and how to negotiate and amend contracts to reflect their intentions. This would be a useful resource for anyone involved in a construction project.\\n \\n\\n 3. \\\"From Concept to Completion: A Guide to Construction Law\\\"\\n \\n\\n In this article, you could provide a comprehensive overview of construction law, from the initial planning stages to the completion of a project. You could discuss the various types of contracts and agreements involved, the legal rights and obligations of homeowners and builders, and the common issues that can arise during a construction project. This would be a valuable resource for anyone looking to better understand the complexities of construction law.\\n \\n\\n I hope these ideas are helpful. Let me know if you would like me to draft some sample articles based on this information, or if you have any other questions or requests.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/493", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Analyze this outline and write me the introduction of YouTube video titled \\\"UFC Story : He Fights Like Bruce Lee - Zabit Magomedsharipov\\\" :\\n\\nInstructions:\\n\\nIntroduction: In the introduction, begin by introducing the fighter and his fighting name. Next, provide a brief overview of his fighting style and key qualities. Use a casual tone, but be sure to convey the necessary information.\\n\\nBackground: In the background section, provide more information about where the fighter grew up and how he got into the fighting sports. Use a casual tone, but be sure to include important details about the fighter's background.\\n\\nFighting history: In the fighting history section, provide an overview of the beginning of the fighter's career and his fights in other organizations before the UFC. Use a casual tone, but be sure to provide important details about the fighter's career.\\n\\nEarly fights: In the early fights section, show footage of the fighter's early fights in other organizations. Be sure to include key moments from these fights to keep the viewer engaged.\\n\\nUFC debut: In the UFC debut section, show the fighter's debut in the UFC and highlight key moments from the fight. Use a casual tone, but be sure to convey the excitement of the fight.\\n\\nTraining: In the training section, show footage of the fighter's training and preparation for his next fight. Use a casual tone, but be sure to provide insight into the fighter's training routine.\\n\\nNext opponent: In the next opponent section, introduce the fighter's next opponent and show highlights to make them look more dangerous. Use a casual tone, but be sure to provide important details about the opponent.\\n\\nStaredowns: In the staredowns section, show footage of the staredowns between the fighter and his opponent. Use a casual tone, but be sure to convey the tension between the two fighters.\\n\\nFinal fight: In the final fight section, show the final fight between the fighter and his opponent and highlight key moments. Use a casual tone, but be sure to convey the excitement of the fight.\\n\\nOutcome: In the outcome section, always show who won the fight. Use a casual tone, but be sure to provide important details about the outcome.\", \"response\": \"Hey there, in this video we're going to talk about the UFC fighter Zabit Magomedsharipov. He's a Russian mixed martial artist who's known for his incredible fighting skills and his unique fighting style. He's been compared to the legendary Bruce Lee, and he's definitely one of the most exciting fighters in the UFC today.\\n\\nZabit grew up in Russia, and he started training in martial arts at a young age. He quickly developed a passion for fighting, and he began competing in various combat sports. He had a successful career in kickboxing and Muay Thai, and he eventually made the transition to mixed martial arts.\\n\\nZabit's fighting style is a mix of different martial arts disciplines, including Muay Thai, kickboxing, and Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu. He's known for his incredible striking skills, and he's able to mix up his attacks with both punches and kicks. He's also a skilled grappler, and he's able to use his wrestling and Jiu-Jitsu skills to take down his opponents and secure submissions.\\n\\nZabit made his UFC debut in 2017, and he quickly made a name for himself as one of the most exciting fighters in the organization. He's known for his incredible speed and agility, and he's able to move around the octagon with ease. He's also known for his incredible striking skills, and he's able to land powerful punches and kicks with ease.\\n\\nIn this video, we're going to take a closer look at Zabit's fighting style and his career in the UFC. We'll also take a look at some of his most impressive fights, and we'll discuss his potential as a future champion in the UFC. So sit back, relax, and let's take a closer look at Zabit Magomedsharipov, the fighter who fights like Bruce Lee.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/8", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Please give us creative product ideas related to air fresheners.\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some creative product ideas related to air fresheners:\\n\\n1. Aromatherapy air fresheners: These air fresheners use essential oils to create a soothing and relaxing atmosphere. They can be used in the home, office, or car and can help to reduce stress and anxiety.\\n\\n2. Natural air fresheners: These air fresheners use natural ingredients like herbs, spices, and essential oils to freshen the air. They are eco-friendly and can be made at home using simple ingredients.\\n\\n3. Motion-activated air fresheners: These air fresheners are triggered by movement, so they only release fragrance when someone is in the room. They are energy-efficient and can be used in small spaces like bathrooms or closets.\\n\\n4. Smart air fresheners: These air fresheners are connected to the internet and can be controlled remotely using a smartphone app. They can be set to release fragrance at specific times or in response to certain triggers like humidity or temperature.\\n\\n5. Personal air fresheners: These air fresheners are small and portable, so they can be used to freshen the air around an individual. They can be worn as a necklace or clipped to a belt and are perfect for people who are sensitive to strong fragrances.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was